OL,5,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThere's harsh criticism,
OL,7,     Faccusations of play-acting and
OL,8,     Ftears on the last day of the
OL,9,     Fcompetition, as the B&Bers meet
OL,10,     Ffor the last time, to find out how
OL,11,     Fmuch they've been paid and who's
OL,12,     Fwon.
